    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;You and I both live on borrowed time.&quot;</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story of two people trying to get back their lost time and memories together.</h2><br>Chikaro is an adventure game based on out-of-body experiences.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2>Yokaze is a boy with magical powers, and Sigmo is an android girl.<br>They wake up, without their memories, in a post-apocalyptic world full of dangerous robots konwn as &quot;amporphi,&quot; who threaten the existence of the few who still live above the ground.<br><br>Yokaze and Sigmo want to know who or what they are. His powers let him summon intentions, a faint trace left behind by those who have passed away. By following the trail of these intentions, the two gradually learn more about the past in a journey that will take them to the very core of this world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780200/extras/64431ed6e803aebd1cec123bb0bba4ca.avif?t=1728639707\" width=640 height=180 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Out-of-body Experiences</h2>By leaving his body and becoming a soul, he can pass through walls or go into enemies' bodies to possess and control them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780200/extras/1c4c463a9f7c161f31bac157ee3271ae.poster.avif?t=1728639707\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780200/extras/1c4c463a9f7c161f31bac157ee3271ae.webm?t=1728639707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780200/extras/1c4c463a9f7c161f31bac157ee3271ae.mp4?t=1728639707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intentions</h2>The intentions of those who have passed away still remain as faint traces scattered throughout the world.<br>When Yokaze, with his magic powers, comes in contact with them, he can read the memories left in those traces.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780200/extras/23432d8b2a27bfa10e7387ca2bcd6a95.avif?t=1728639707\" width=640 height=132 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;You and I both live on borrowed time.&quot;</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story of two people trying to get back their lost time and memories together.</h2><br>Chikaro is an adventure game based on out-of-body experiences.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2>Yokaze is a boy with magical powers, and Sigmo is an android girl.<br>They wake up, without their memories, in a post-apocalyptic world full of dangerous robots konwn as &quot;amporphi,&quot; who threaten the existence of the few who still live above the ground.<br><br>Yokaze and Sigmo want to know who or what they are. His powers let him summon intentions, a faint trace left behind by those who have passed away. By following the trail of these intentions, the two gradually learn more about the past in a journey that will take them to the very core of this world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780200/extras/64431ed6e803aebd1cec123bb0bba4ca.avif?t=1728639707\" width=640 height=180 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Out-of-body Experiences</h2>By leaving his body and becoming a soul, he can pass through walls or go into enemies' bodies to possess and control them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780200/extras/1c4c463a9f7c161f31bac157ee3271ae.poster.avif?t=1728639707\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780200/extras/1c4c463a9f7c161f31bac157ee3271ae.webm?t=1728639707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780200/extras/1c4c463a9f7c161f31bac157ee3271ae.mp4?t=1728639707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intentions</h2>The intentions of those who have passed away still remain as faint traces scattered throughout the world.<br>When Yokaze, with his magic powers, comes in contact with them, he can read the memories left in those traces.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780200/extras/23432d8b2a27bfa10e7387ca2bcd6a95.avif?t=1728639707\" width=640 height=132 /></span>",
